| Stage                               | Purpose                         | Popular Tools                                          | What They Do                                                  |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Planning**                        | Manage work items               | Jira, Azure Boards, Trello                             | Track user stories, bugs, tasks, and sprints                  |
| **Source Code Management (SCM)**    | Store source code               | Git, GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket                         | Version control, branching, merging, pull requests            |
| **Build**                           | Compile/package code            | Maven, Gradle, MSBuild, npm                            | Build applications and resolve dependencies                   |
| **Continuous Integration (CI)**     | Automate build and testing      | Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Azure Pipelines, GitLab CI    | Trigger builds, run tests, create artifacts                   |
| **Artifact Repository**             | Store build artifacts           | Nexus Repository, JFrog Artifactory, GitHub Packages   | Store JARs, Docker images, NuGet packages, etc.               |
| **Infrastructure as Code (IaC)**    | Provision infrastructure        | Terraform, Bicep, ARM Templates, CloudFormation        | Create cloud resources automatically                          |
| **Configuration Management**        | Configure servers               | Ansible, Puppet, Chef, SaltStack                       | Install software, manage configuration, enforce desired state |
| **Containerization**                | Package applications            | Docker, Podman                                         | Build and run applications in containers                      |
| **Container Registry**              | Store container images          | Docker Hub, Azure Container Registry (ACR), Amazon ECR | Store and manage Docker images                                |
| **Container Orchestration**         | Manage containers at scale      | Kubernetes, OpenShift, Amazon EKS, Azure AKS           | Deploy, scale, and manage containers                          |
| **Package Management (Kubernetes)** | Deploy Kubernetes apps          | Helm                                                   | Package and deploy Kubernetes applications using charts       |
| **Continuous Deployment (CD)**      | Automate deployments            | Argo CD, Flux CD, Azure Pipelines, GitHub Actions      | Deploy applications to environments automatically             |
| **Monitoring**                      | Monitor infrastructure and apps | Prometheus, Azure Monitor, CloudWatch                  | Collect metrics and monitor system health                     |
| **Visualization**                   | Display dashboards              | Grafana                                                | Visualize metrics and create dashboards                       |
| **Logging**                         | Collect and search logs         | ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana), Loki      | Centralized log collection and analysis                       |
| **Security Scanning**               | Find vulnerabilities            | Trivy, SonarQube, Snyk, Microsoft Defender for Cloud   | Scan code, containers, and infrastructure for security issues |
| **Secrets Management**              | Secure sensitive data           | HashiCorp Vault, Azure Key Vault, AWS Secrets Manager  | Store passwords, API keys, and certificates securely          |
